"name":"Ignatius Farray","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2tjWEjbmw2WlkVxSEQksRDn1aOS.jpg"},{"id":111090,"name":"Javier Botet","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nuVbt1oreUUPPR0MhKKL7y6i9Dt.jpg"},{"id":1149062,"name":"Adrián Pino","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m1SqjMZAtnx4T6iEJ8DA8jgfvgL.jpg"},{"id":1171836,"name":"Luisa Gavasa","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wpw0QjiM1JhTVA7YlgBXOhQ30q6.jpg"},{"id":2168107,"name":"Victor Rebull","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/locdIJLnX1elVJr3ufV4sprk6Yh.jpg"},{"id":3869167,"name":"Numa Paredes","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g9ccZ4j2hEFeand2aW0a2pFGgiz.jpg"},{"id":4442280,"name":"Cristian de la Tierra"},{"id":4442279,"name":"Dani Mantero","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ZgSGIyH0NFH5opONcExgGFxCkb.jpg"},{"id":3739633,"name":"Irene Pérez","role":"Noa","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zH4jHmV5aExVU8dK76yvWHLyCZG.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","overview":"Il giorno in cui è prevista l'apocalisse, Tomás si sveglia con i postumi di una sbornia nel bel mezzo di un'orgia in un noto centro commerciale. Mesi prima, di fronte alla notizia della fine del mondo, aveva abbandonato la moglie Julia e la figlia Noa senza voltarsi indietro. Ma quando il pianeta errante che stava per schiantarsi sulla Terra ci evita e il mondo continua a girare, Tomás si rende conto della portata del suo errore. Ora cercherà di recuperare gli errori passati e di ottenere il perdono della sua famiglia, cercando di ricostruire un mondo che dopo la mancata apocalisse, non sarà mai più come prima."},{"language":"en-US","title":"En Fin","overview":"After the Apocalypse doesn't happen, Tomas tries to recover his past life, with little success, while Julia sees in the Non-End of the World a second chance to change her life. Their paths, opposites, will have to converge in the only thing that unites them right now: their daughter Noa."},{"language":"es-ES","overview":"El día en el que debería llegar el apocalipsis, Tomás se levanta resacoso en mitad de una orgía en un conocido centro comercial. Hace meses, ante la noticia del fin del mundo, abandonó a su mujer Julia y a su hija Noa sin mirar atrás. Pero cuando el planeta errante que iba a chocar contra la Tierra pasa de largo y el mundo sigue girando, Tomás comprende la magnitud de su error. Ahora tratará de recuperar su vida pasada y obtener el perdón de su familia, buscando reconstruir tras el no-apocalipsis un mundo que ya nunca volverá a ser el de antes.","tagline":"El apocalipsis son los padres"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/npIIDisD7q5pXzKIwhauUr4JFhY.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/npIIDisD7q5pXzKIwhauUr4JFhY.png","language":"es","width":1932,"height":567}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6YzDtyY1lFDPHul33rl2sfn3pNf.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6YzDtyY1lFDPHul33rl2sfn3pNf.jpg","language":"es","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zhx4evfd3khHyQ7KgBsJpj6Ioct.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zhx4evfd3khHyQ7KgBsJpj6Ioct.jpg","language":"es","width":600,"height":900},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b2W2nBRdePVKgUWMNdrjkubBh5F.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/b2W2nBRdePVKgUWMNdrjkubBh5F.jpg","language":"es","width":1192,"height":1788},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dzR1kQK9QEMpili5slriNUO6w9d.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dzR1kQK9QEMpili5slriNUO6w9d.jpg","language":"es","width":600,"height":900},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rnMnX7sjxaXLnPyHJB0PeSspvSF.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rnMnX7sjxaXLnPyHJB0PeSspvSF.jpg","language":"es","width":2000,"height":3000},